9. MS. HUMA AKHTER CHUGHTA|, MNA to move that the Bill to provide for the establishment of thePakistan lnstitute of Management, Sciences and Technology [The Pakistan lnstitute of Management,Sciences and Technology Bill, 20231, be passed.10. MS. ERUM HAM|D, MNA, to move that the Bill for establishment of the National University forSecurity Sciences [The National University for Security Sciences, lslamabad Bill, 2023], as passed by theMajlis-e-Shoora (Parliament) and returned by the President, be taken into consideration at once underclause (2) of Article 75 of the Constitution of the lslamic Republic of Pakistan'11. M5. ERUM HAMID, MNA, to move that the Bill for establishment of the National university forsecurity sciences [The National university for security sciences, lsla mabad 9il, 20231, be passed.L2. MS. TAHTRA AURANGZEB, MNA, to move that the Bill for the establishment of Akhuwat lnstituteKasur [The Akhuwat lnstitute Kasur Bill, 2023], as passed by the Majlis-e-shoora (Parliament) and returnedby the president, be taken into consideration at once under clause (2) of Article 75 of the Constitution ofthe lslamic Republic of Pakistan.13. MS. TAHTRA AURANGZEB, MNA, to move that the Bill for the establishment of Akhuwat InstituteKasur [The Akhuwat lnstitute Kasur Bill,2023l, be passed.L4. MS. SAMTNA KHAuD GHURK|, MNA, to move that the Bill to provide for the establishment of theGhurki tnstttute of Science and Technology [The Ghurki lnstitute of Science and Technology Bill, 2025], aspassed by the National Assembly and not passed by the senate within ninety days, be taken intoconsideration at once under clause (3) of Article 70 of the constitution of the lslamic Republic of Pakistan.[Amendments in a separate list to be moved]15. MS. SAM|NA KHALTD GHURK|, MNA, to move that the Bill to provide for the establishment of theGhurki tnstitute of Science and Technology [The Ghurki lnstitute of Science and Technology Bill, 2025], bepassed.
